{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Aquilon</strong> \u2013 a legendary city where the shadows of dungeons intertwine with the fury of gladiator battles and ruthless decisions. Here, the fates of slaves, desperate adventurers, ambitious aristocrats, the poor, and monster hunters looking to strike it rich are decided. In this brutal world, you're one of those willing to risk everything for a chance to change your destiny, where blood and desire are the ultimate currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172670/extras/62bcaf48fc3b6dbede957be007ba97c7.poster.avif?t=1762751190\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172670/extras/62bcaf48fc3b6dbede957be007ba97c7.webm?t=1762751190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172670/extras/62bcaf48fc3b6dbede957be007ba97c7.mp4?t=1762751190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You\u2019ve always known how to profit from gladiator fights, especially when it comes to betting on the battles of seductive beauties. But luck turned against you \u2014 you lost everything, including the borrowed money from one of the city\u2019s most powerful figures. Just when it seemed like you were out of options, fate handed you another chance: to become the owner and trainer at your uncle\u2019s estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172670/extras/8dd2661108c9baad0a1642b3a9e64f56.poster.avif?t=1762751190\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.